  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp increases in oil prices raise energy and logistics costs for firms, worsening automation project economics and delaying or reducing the pace at which organizations implement capital‑intensive AI automation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
