  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher oil prices improve project economics and return projections, prompting increased private and public investment pledges or reactivation of suspended upstream projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
