  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained spike in oil prices raises near-term CPI and inflation expectations, prompting markets to reprice toward higher expected central-bank policy rates over the policy horizon.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">monetary_bond_stress</data>
