  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in the geopolitical market risk premium causes global asset managers and cross‑border investors to de‑risk and reduce allocations to duration- and credit-sensitive bonds and emerging-market assets, producing net outflows from bond markets.</data>
