  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger political‑military alignment among allied states facilitates coordinated export controls, standards and joint regulatory actions targeting dual‑use AI capabilities, increasing the intensity and coordination of AI regulation.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
