  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher political‑military coordination among allied states enables synchronized sanctions, investment bans and due‑diligence pressure that promptly deter or block private and public investor commitments into targeted country's oil assets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
