  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher political‑military cohesion among allies leads to more frequent, coordinated and hawkish public statements and joint policy declarations that amplify the intensity of policy signaling to markets.</data>
