  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating international legal actions, targeted litigations or certification disputes create legal/political pretexts and evidence used by states to justify and broaden sanctions packages against implicated actors or states.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_geopolitics_shift</data>
