  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher-performing models enable more accurate reservoir simulation, real‑time completion optimization and drilling control algorithms that increase throughput and recoverable output from existing wells.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_tech_competition</data>
