  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher AI capability accelerates development and deployment of maritime ISR, autonomous drones and precision targeting aids for state and proxy forces in the Gulf, increasing the tempo and accuracy of interdictions and low‑level kinetic encounters that raise tanker incident rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_tech_competition</data>
