  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Consolidation among dominant AI/cloud providers leads operators to sign exclusive platform and control‑system contracts that give those external vendors operational access and de facto control rights over extraction and processing systems.</data>
