  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster fielding of AI-enabled autonomous and remotely operated systems (loitering munitions, armed drones, automated logistics) increases the number of deployable combat-capable platforms and effective force multipliers available to actors in the theatre.</data>
